{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"303eb9a7054759b485a8ac5b94219ad36cfe4805a8e62c09308e66a09f9faef2","ja":"本当の優勝は？","zh":"真正的胜利是？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6e334401fe245542ef8a02ce23572d2e2bbf813feb1946da2119cfc769060e45","ja":"こうなったら、真美も審査してもらうかんね！\n真美の選んだベストオブチャーミングなぬいぐるみ！","zh":"既然都这样了，真美也要请大家来评审！\n看真美选出的最可爱迷人毛绒玩偶！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"af7a7fba1dab2b0b4a496d224fc41ac7994b25a72bfe425aa84302ca1003d5f3","ja":"……じゃじゃーんっ！！","zh":"……锵锵——！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"95f16008910583a085a21b2c4893f598b34ab17ac6c127a16053a3c0d50e7d26","ja":"それ、さっきの……！！","zh":"那个不是刚才的……！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"367f63f10dc779a93d26b69270878061dbc9b9bad4d3993ebfec1d55ab53eaad","ja":"「スタジオのみなさんから、困惑の声があがってます。\nそれは、なんの動物でしょうか？」","zh":"“演播室的各位都纷纷表示感到困惑。\n请问那是什么动物呢？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"153acd5de3412e3c44af13d587b165ecdb2891036fe6366dce495c49249a406e","ja":"ワタシたちもわからないヨ～。でも、\n一回見たら忘れられないくらいインパクトあるよネ！","zh":"我们也不知道呀～。不过，\n看上一眼就让人印象深刻到忘不掉呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"67351a746bbbb4eb0a9cd399646f0165a2da6d8b87188e9dbfc3eb1fd9153066","ja":"このぬいぐるみも、\nチャーミング枠で審査してよ～！","zh":"这个玩偶也，\n放到迷人分组里去审查嘛～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"938cc2d4c46ce83a4856d4e8d35c094250d5b18ed53f6422caf2c0e3ff4a99ae","ja":"あ、だったら、私が選んだキーホルダーも……あれ？\nそのぬいぐるみ、これに描かれてる子と似てるね？","zh":"啊，既然这样，那我选的钥匙扣也……咦？\n那个玩偶，和这上面画的角色挺像的呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"74c964f4e3f972c6fa9c77a36441db7548f91507444ba85129f297840806a0b1","ja":"似てるって言うか、同じキャラクターだよ！\nすごい偶然ね……。","zh":"与其说是像，根本就是同一个角色啦！\n真是太巧了呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"fc49ab614ff78b84c254c856538c03681ff5de50e696d4cce069164a5b0140f7","ja":"そんなに有名なキャラクターなのかしら～？\n初めて見たけど……。","zh":"是很著名的角色吗～？\n虽然我是第一次见……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"c03649630041a6a1c842d1b848fd79c6a3701a6f320f76ef2e3512768f17d01b","ja":"「ええと……では4択に変えて、スタジオの\n観客のみなさんにジャッジしてもらいましょう！」","zh":"「那个……那么改成4选一，让演播室的\n观众朋友们来评判吧！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"0bd0b013a534d03fdc066274c8e00a20220c6e62ee6f0574f38458a89637b04b","ja":"「一番お題に沿ったものはどれ？\nジャッジ、スタートッ！！」","zh":"“最符合题意的是哪个？\n裁定，开始！！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"61f008a6cb1fa48dd51ee65abde9fde845d9a4b58493ceff45715cf9d2e74d4e","ja":"惜しかったな～。オルゴールと\nスウィーティーが10点で、同点優勝。","zh":"好可惜啊～。八音盒和\n甜心都是10分，并列第一。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"938ac237dc8eec0a40da372cd021b2233d5ca3185dd612e0ae763b1df7741348","ja":"真美のぬいぐるみと、麗花お姉ちゃんのキーホルダーは\n6点づつなんて……。","zh":"真美的玩偶和丽花姐姐的钥匙扣，\n竟然各值6分……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"0ca59d7b0c0e46973604244b7e1ccf57f8f8d3b9ced1d0e92022174e59006c1a","ja":"……あっ、でも、真美ちゃんのと私のは、\n同じキャラクターだよね。ってことは……。","zh":"……啊，不过，真美的和我的，\n是同一个角色吧。也就是说……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"7b43be29d7292c98e8d269ff6c3cb5b67dd9d427db1f524d32c12b242f0fe171","ja":"同じアイテムって考えていいんじゃないかな？","zh":"当成同一种道具应该就可以了吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"5d55c7c22b340282b3318cc27b52d57d05c9e2daa2611daa4de2efaa05129df9","ja":"それじゃ、2つ合わせて12点？\nんじゃあ、真美たちの勝ちってこと？","zh":"那么，2个加起来是12分？\n这么说，是真美他们赢了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"bd48527b744f9d0838f145a65ad9802a20801cb06d3c9dfca404581d38ee7691","ja":"そうそう♪　つまりこのキャラクターは……\nすっごくチャーミングでスウィーティってことだね♪","zh":"对对♪　也就是说这个角色……\n非常迷人又甜美对吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"d1e7eeba1f01dd074906882f83840ed0cef83382a8ab2aea03b4f2265a89515e","ja":"うふふっ♪　ふたりともすごいわね～。\nとってもポジティブに考えることができて。","zh":"呵呵♪　你们两个真厉害呢～。\n能思考得这么积极乐观。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"edd035fa62f1acdf277d40f66e04a1075a2fe45ac9e9d64bdadb28484794a80d","ja":"私には、あのキャラの魅力は\n理解できそうにないけど……。","zh":"我感觉自己\n可能没法理解那个角色的魅力就是了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1710.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"e14904b4f5b67a33460f60f83655619dc67b4daac4139a61a10aab4cd6dab4bb","ja":"ふたりが楽しそうなら、それでいいわよね♪","zh":"两个人看起来玩得开心，那就好啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
